<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">As per <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3514258085" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41531" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41531/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41531">#41531</a>, we should explain how to remove implicit anchor associations, for example, those created between customizable selects and their pickers. This PR aims to add that information to the site.</p>
<p dir="auto">I have explained it in one central place, then provided abbreviated notes linking to that section in other appropriate places. I'm not convinced it needs linking from every single popover-related page that mentions the implicit association, but I'm happy to take opinions on that.</p>

